    <value>查看系列详情</value>
    <comment>View Series Details</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageCannotSendSeriesScheduledForDeletion" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>计划删除的序列无法发送。</value>
    <comment>Series scheduled for deletion cannot be sent.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageConfirmDeleteEntireStudy" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>删除剩余的序列将导致整个检查被删除。您确定要删除整个检查吗？</value>
    <comment>Deleting the remaining series will cause the entire study to be deleted. Are you sure you want to delete the entire study?</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageConfirmDeleteSeries" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>确实要删除选定的序列吗？</value>
    <comment>Are you sure you want to delete the selected series?</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageConfirmSendToMultipleServers" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>您已选择要发送的多个服务器。你确定你要继续吗？</value>
    <comment>You have selected multiple servers to send to.  Are you sure you want to continue?</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageFailedToDeleteSeries" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>无法启动序列的删除。</value>
    <comment>Failed to initiate deletion of the series.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageFailedToRetrieveSeries" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>无法启动检索所选项目。</value>
    <comment>Failed to initiate retrieving of the selected items.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageFailedToSendSeries" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>无法启动发送所选项目。</value>
    <comment>Failed to initiate sending of the selected items.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageFormatConfirmDeleteSeries" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>确实要删除 {0} 选定的系列吗？</value>
    <comment>Are you sure you want to delete the {0} selected series?</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageFormatDeleteSeriesScheduled" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>已安排删除研究中{1} [{2}，A＃：{3}]的{0}序列。</value>
    <comment>The deletion of {0} series in the study for {1} [{2},A#:{3}] has been scheduled.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageFormatRetrieveSeriesScheduled" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>已安排从{1}检索{2} [{3}，A＃：{4}]的{0}序列。</value>
    <comment>The retrieve of {0} series for {2} [{3},A#:{4}] from {1} has been scheduled.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageFormatSendSeriesScheduled" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>已安排将{0}序列发送至{1} {2} [{3}，A＃：{4}]。</value>
    <comment>The send of {0} series to {1} for {2} [{3},A#:{4}] has been scheduled.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessagePartialStudyWarning" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>删除序列可能会影响部分检查数据，这可能导致患者误诊。</value>
    <comment>Deleting series may result in partial study data, which could lead to patient misdiagnosis.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageRetrieveDicomServerServiceNotRunning" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>无法检索所选序列，因为DICOM Server服务未运行。请确保Intelligent  服务正在运行或联系您的系统管理员以获取帮助。</value>
    <comment>Failed to retrieve the selected series because the DICOM Server service is not running.
Please ensure the ClearCanvas Service is running or contact your system administrator for assistance.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageSelectDestination" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>请选择目的地。</value>
    <comment>Please select a destination.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageSelectSeriesNotAlreadyScheduledForDeletion" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>请选择尚未计划删除的序列。</value>
    <comment>Please select series that are not already scheduled for deletion.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageSendDicomServerServiceNotRunning" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>由于DICOM Server服务未运行，因此无法发送所选检查。请确保 Intelligent  服务正在运行或联系您的系统管理员以获取帮助。</value>
    <comment>Failed to send the selected studies because the DICOM Server service is not running.
Please ensure the ClearCanvas Service is running or contact your system administrator for assistance.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MessageStudyInUse" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>所选择的检查目前正在使用中。请在删除前关闭所有相关工作区。</value>
    <comment>The selected study is currently in use.  Please close all relevant workspaces before deleting.</comment>
  </data>
